{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こここんばんは！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいま北海道にやってきております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/19/3823976/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみのGMT"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/19/3823976/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーーーー\n緊張するなーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手と下手どっちがいいか\n言いたいところなんだけど...\nまんべんなくいろーんなところに\n移動するんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下手...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー今回は下手が多いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもめっちゃ下手に行くと\n上手が見えないよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててくださいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日文化放送の乃木のの！\n聴きましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/19/3823976/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩とかずずとまりか\nリラックスしておしゃべりできました。\nいつもと変わらん感じだった。\nまた呼んでください！\n次こそは噛みません！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は札幌zepp。\n盛り上がっていくぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/19/3823976/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/19/3823976/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}